WHAT LANDED. tagpu_peek_frame, tagpu_weapons_frame, tagpu_ui_frame,
tagpu_cat_frame and tagpu_scenario_frame left tagpu_overlay_draw --
reached only from render_ogl.c:1632 and render_vk.c:232 -- for a new
